> Customizing Mango - Layouts

Layout configuration is in ~/.config/mango/layouts.conf

### Circle Layout

`circle_layout=dwindle,scroller,vertical_scroller,center_tile,tile`
defines the order for *super+shift+A* (cycle layouts).

### Tab Bar

`tab_bar_height = 0`: height of window tab bar (0 = hidden).

### Scratchpad

`scratchpad_cross_monitor=1`: allow scratchpad to work across monitors.

### Scroller Settings

`scroller_structs=20`: number of slot structures in scroller.
`scroller_default_proportion=0.8`: default window width as fraction of monitor.
`scroller_focus_center=0`: don't center focused window.
`scroller_prefer_center=0`: don't prefer centering.
`edge_scroller_pointer_focus=1`: focus follows mouse at edges.
`scroller_default_proportion_single=1.0`: single window fills monitor.
`scroller_proportion_preset=0.15,0.3,0.5,0.8,1.0`: ratios cycled by *super+A*.

### Master/Stack (Tile) Settings

`new_is_master=1`: new windows become master.
`default_mfact=0.75`: master area ratio (75% of screen).
`default_nmaster=1`: number of master windows.
`smartgaps=0`: disable smart gaps when only one window.
`center_when_single_stack=0`: don't center single stack window.
`center_master_overspread=1`: center master window when it overspreads.

### Overview Settings

`hotarea_size=15`: corner trigger size in pixels.
`enable_hotarea=1`: enable hot corner for overview.
`hotarea_corner=0`: top-left corner (0=TL, 1=TR, 2=BL, 3=BR).
`ov_tab_mode=1`: tab-based overview cycling.
`overviewgappi=5`: inner gap between windows in overview.
`overviewgappo=30`: outer gap around overview.

### Dwindle Settings

`dwindle_split_ratio=0.5`: 50/50 split ratio.
`dwindle_smart_split=0`: disable smart splitting.
`dwindle_hsplit=0`: force horizontal splitting.
`dwindle_vsplit=0`: force vertical splitting.
`dwindle_preserve_split=1`: preserve split direction.
`dwindle_smart_resize=0`: disable smart resize.
`dwindle_drop_simple_split=0`: disable simple drop split.

### Tag Layout Rules

set default layouts per workspace/tag:
tagrule=id:1,layout_name:dwindle,
tagrule=id:2,layout_name:dwindle,
etc. (all 9 tags default to dwindle)
